## Move MCP example scripts under resources/examples
================================================================================

Context: The standalone MCP client and benchmark scripts lived in a top-level
``examples/`` folder. They are developer tools rather than app code, so they
are moved under ``resources/examples/``. ``resources/`` is excluded from the
Apps workspace sync in ``databricks.yml`` and only ``*.yml`` files there are
read by DAB, so the scripts are not uploaded to the workspace and do not affect
the bundle.

Changes:

1. resources/examples/mcp_client.py (moved from examples/mcp_client.py)
   Generic OntoBricks MCP client; moved with ``git mv``, content unchanged.
2. resources/examples/mcp_bench.py (moved from examples/mcp_bench.py)
   MCP benchmark harness; moved with ``git mv``, content unchanged.
3. tests/units/examples/conftest.py
   ``EXAMPLES_DIR`` now points at ``resources/examples``.
4. tests/units/examples/test_mcp_client_example.py
   Docstring path updated to ``resources/examples/mcp_client.py``.
5. tests/units/examples/test_mcp_bench_example.py
   Docstring path updated to ``resources/examples/mcp_bench.py``.
6. docs/mcp.md
   Link targets and ``python3`` command examples updated to
   ``resources/examples/``.

